  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to justice through restorative justice, prevention   empowerment mechanisms Extension.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve access to justice in 40 of total 64 districts by reducing the number of cases sent via the criminal judicial system. This will benefit up to 2 million poor people and reduce the remand population up to 18,512 in 40 prisons.</narrative>
  </description>
